# Walkthrough - Search & UX Improvements

I have resolved several critical issues with the search functionality and improved the user experience.

## Changes

### 1. Fixed "Black Screen" on Search
- **Cause**: The search filter was trying to look for a `tags` property on the tools, but this property doesn't exist.
- **Fix**: Removed the faulty code in [src/pages/Index.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Escritorio/tonos-tool-treasurebox/src/pages/Index.tsx).

### 2. Fixed "No Results" (Hidden Tools)
- **Cause**: Tools were being hidden if their category also contained subcategories.
- **Fix**: Updated [CategorySection.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Escritorio/tonos-tool-treasurebox/CategorySection.tsx) to display both subcategories and tools if they exist.

### 3. Improved Search Result Positioning
- **Feedback**: Users had to scroll to the bottom of the page to see search results.
- **Fix**: Refactored [src/pages/Index.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Escritorio/tonos-tool-treasurebox/src/pages/Index.tsx) to display search results **immediately below the search bar**, temporarily hiding the other dashboard content (calculators, etc.) while searching. This provides a much cleaner, focused search experience.

### 4. Removed Lovable Logo
- **Cause**: Default favicon persistence.
- **Fix**: Created and linked a new [favicon.svg](file:///c:/Users/Antonio/OneDrive/Escritorio/tonos-tool-treasurebox/public/favicon.svg) to force the browser to update.

## Verification
- **Build**: The application builds successfully.
- **Search**: 
    1. Type in the search bar.
    2. Results appear instantly at the top of the page.
    3. The rest of the page content (calculators, wizards) is hidden to focus on results.
    4. Clearing the search restores the full dashboard.
